cat > "$POSTS_DIR/2026-01-25-wedding-florist-ritz-carlton-lake-tahoe-truckee.md" << 'POSTEOF'
---
layout: post
title: "Getting Married at The Ritz-Carlton Lake Tahoe? Here's What Your Flowers Should Look Like"
date: 2026-01-25
permalink: /natures-canvas-lake-tahoe-wedding-flowers/wedding-florist-ritz-carlton-lake-tahoe-truckee/
description: "If you're getting married at The Ritz-Carlton Lake Tahoe, the venue already does the heavy lifti"
---

<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">If you're getting married at The Ritz-Carlton Lake Tahoe, you already know the venue does the heavy lifting. Perched mid-mountain at Northstar California in Truckee, it's California's only AAA Five Diamond mountain resort, and it shows. Soaring wood-beam ceilings, floor-to-ceiling windows, wrought-iron chandeliers, and views of the Sierra Nevada that stop guests in their tracks.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">So what does that mean for your flowers?</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">It means your florals need to be just as intentional as the setting, not competing with it, but becoming part of it.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Let the landscape lead</strong></p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">The Ritz-Carlton Lake Tahoe is a venue defined by its natural surroundings. The Woods ceremony site sits beneath towering Sierra pines that filter afternoon light in a way no ballroom can replicate. The Fireside Terrace is anchored by a seven-foot fireplace with views stretching beyond the gondola towers. The Meadows offers an open alpine backdrop that changes with every season.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">The worst thing you can do in a setting like this is bring in flowers that look like they were shipped from a warehouse. Tight, uniform, tropical blooms fight the mountain landscape instead of honoring it.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">What works here is wild, seasonal, and locally rooted, the kind of florals that look like they belong to the Sierra Nevadas because they do.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>What we recommend for Ritz-Carlton weddings</strong></p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">For ceremonies in The Woods or The Meadows, we love loose, organic arrangements that echo the wildflower meadows of the Sierra Nevada. Think garden roses, ranunculus, sweet peas, anemones, dahlias and foraged greenery, nothing too structured, nothing too perfect.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">For the Ritz-Carlton Ballroom or Pines Ballroom receptions, you have the ceiling height and the architecture to go big. Ground-level installations, tall arrangements in statement vessels, and lush tablescapes that nod to the mountain setting while still feeling elevated and luxurious.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">For the Fireside Terrace cocktail hour, keep it simple. A few well-placed arrangements that don't compete with the fireplace or the views. This is a space that sells itself, let it.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>A real Golden Flowers wedding at the Ritz</strong></p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">We had the privilege of designing florals for Sara's wedding at The Ritz-Carlton Truckee, a couple who wanted a luxe look without the full-service price tag. We designed the ceremony installation and bouquets, and adorned the tables with bud vases. The result was stunning, personal, and completely in budget.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">"Golden flowers was genuine in making our wedding day florals what I had in mind. She had ideas that helped me to stay in budget and achieve the luxe look I wanted.", Sara, The Ritz-Carlton Truckee</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Ready to plan your Ritz-Carlton Lake Tahoe wedding flowers?</strong></p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">We serve couples getting married throughout the Lake Tahoe area including Truckee, Northstar, Incline Village, and the greater Sierra Nevadas. Whether you're planning a full-service wedding or looking for our à la carte menu, we'd love to be part of your day.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Schedule a consultation with us at <a href="http://goldenflorals.com">goldenflorals.com</a> or email us at brittany@goldenflorals.com</p></div>
POSTEOF

