<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" id="yui_3_17_2_1_1780086573028_1987">The Team That Made It Happen</h2><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Days like Emma and Ross's don't happen without a vendor community that knows how to work together. We were honored to share the floor with:</p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Photography:</strong>&nbsp;Nichole Lee Photo</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Videography:</strong>&nbsp;Abel Guitron Photography</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Hair &amp; Makeup:</strong>&nbsp;Polish and Pout</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Jewelry:</strong>&nbsp;Sierra Moon Goldsmiths</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>Cake:</strong>&nbsp;Crave Cakes</p></li></ul><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Every one of these vendors brought craft and intention to Emma and Ross's day, and it showed in every frame.</p><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Planning a Lake Tahoe Mountain Wedding?</h2><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">If you're engaged and considering a Sierra Nevada or Lake Tahoe area wedding, we'd love to talk. Golden Flowers is a boutique wedding florist based in Incline Village, Nevada, designing foam-free, locally sourced florals for mountain weddings across the Tahoe basin and beyond.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">We take on a limited number of weddings each season so that every one gets our full attention. If your date is still open,&nbsp;<a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="/consultation-form">reach out here</a>&nbsp;, we'd love to hear about your vision.</p><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><em>Golden Flowers · 885 Tahoe Blvd, Incline Village, NV · (530) 557-7689 ·&nbsp;</em><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://goldenflorals.com/"><em>goldenflorals.com</em></a></p></div>
